# Corpora are cloned, pinned by revision, and never committed. The mined cases
# under evaluation/cases/ are committed instead, so the evaluation reproduces
# without re-walking anyone's history.
.corpora/

# Scoring output is derived from the committed cases plus a corpus clone, and
# changes with every run. The numbers that matter are quoted in the README
# against the commit that produced them, rather than left here to go stale.
evaluation/results/
